  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - Reason for Approval\r\n\r\nThe use of the site as coach/bus storage and limousine service with ancillary offices is neither detrimental to the appearance of the property nor has a harmful effect on adjoining and neighbouring properties.  It provides a suitable level of employment and parking and servicing arrangements ensure that there are no adverse traffic impacts on the local highway network.  It therefore complies with policies ENV-B.1.1, E.2.1, T.1.4 and T.4.3 of the London Borough of Hounslow Unitary Development Plan, adopted December 2003.\r\n",
    "Condition : 2 - The premises shall only be used for coach/bus storage and for ancillary offices in connection with a limousine service and thereafter it shall revert to B2 and B8 uses. \r\n\r\n",
    "Condition : 3 - The ancillary office use shall provide administrative support to the limousine service with no 'pick-ups' or 'drop-offs' at the premises.\r\n\r\n\r\n"
  ],
